  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OTI Iraq Resilience Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Iraq):  Office of Transition Initiatives (OTI) Iraq Regional Program (IRP) II, implemented by Chemonics International, aims to increase stability in Iraq by helping communities affected by ISIS recover, while working toward a more pluralistic and cohesive country capable of addressing threats to Iraq&apos;s security and regional stability. OTI partners with faith-based groups, CSOs, community groups, local media outlets, and local governments to quickly implement activities that empower inclusive civic action and address social issues that threaten stability. Geographic focus areas for OTI in Iraq include the Ninewa Plain, Mosul, Sinjar, Western Anbar, Basra, and Dhi Qar.</narrative>
  </description>
